ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR SMART CONTRACTS:

The smart contracts included in this Software are deployed on public blockchains
and are subject to the immutability and transparency characteristics of blockchain
technology. Once deployed, smart contracts cannot be modified or deleted.

Users deploying smart contracts from this Software:
- Are responsible for testing and auditing contracts before mainnet deployment
- Should seek professional security audits for production deployments
- Must comply with all applicable laws and regulations in their jurisdiction
- Acknowledge that blockchain transactions are irreversible

